{
    "chapter_num": 35,
    "verses_count": 29,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jacob’s Return to Bethel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then God said to Jacob, “Arise, go up to Bethel and dwell there; and make an altar there to God, who appeared to you when you fled from the face of Esau your brother.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jacob said to his household and to all who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him, “Put away the foreign gods that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " among you, purify yourselves, and change your garments. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then let us arise and go up to Bethel; and I will make an altar there to God, who answered me in the day of my distress and has been with me in the way which I have gone.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they gave Jacob all the foreign "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "idols"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "gods which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in their hands, and the earrings which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in their ears; and Jacob hid them under the terebinth tree which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by Shechem."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they journeyed, and the terror of God was upon the cities that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " all around them, and they did not pursue the sons of Jacob. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jacob came to Luz (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Bethel), which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in the land of Canaan, he and all the people who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he built an altar there and called the place "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. God of the House of God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "El Bethel, because there God appeared to him when he fled from the face of his brother."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Deborah, Rebekah’s nurse, died, and she was buried below Bethel under the terebinth tree. So the name of it was called "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Terebinth of Weeping"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Allon Bachuth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then God appeared to Jacob again, when he came from Padan Aram, and blessed him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God said to him, “Your name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jacob; your name shall not be called Jacob anymore, but Israel shall be your name.” So He called his name Israel. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also God said to him: “I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God Almighty. Be fruitful and multiply; a nation and a company of nations shall proceed from you, and kings shall come from your body. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The land which I gave Abraham and Isaac I give to you; and to your descendants after you I give this land.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then God went"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "departed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " up from him in the place where He talked with him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jacob set up a pillar in the place where He talked with him, a pillar of stone; and he poured a drink offering on it, and he poured oil on it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jacob called the name of the place where God spoke with him, Bethel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Death of Rachel"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they journeyed from Bethel. And when there was but a little distance to go to Ephrath, Rachel labored "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "in childbirth,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and she had hard labor. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it came to pass, when she was in hard labor, that the midwife said to her, “Do not fear; you will have this son also.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And so it was, as her soul was departing (for she died), that she called his name "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of My Sorrow"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Ben-Oni; but his father called him "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Son of the Right Hand"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Benjamin. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Rachel died and was buried on the way to Ephrath (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Bethlehem). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jacob set a pillar on her grave, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the pillar of Rachel’s grave to this day."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Israel journeyed and pitched his tent beyond the tower of Eder. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it happened, when Israel dwelt in that land, that Reuben went and lay with Bilhah his father’s concubine; and Israel heard "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "about it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the sons of Jacob were twelve: "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jacob’s Twelve Sons"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the sons of Leah "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Reuben, Jacob’s firstborn, and Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, and Zebulun; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the sons of Rachel "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Joseph and Benjamin; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the sons of Bilhah, Rachel’s maidservant, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Dan and Naphtali; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and the sons of Zilpah, Leah’s maidservant, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Gad and Asher. These "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the sons of Jacob who were born to him in Padan Aram."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Death of Isaac"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jacob came to his father Isaac at Mamre, or Kirjath Arba"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. Town or City of Arba"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " (that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Hebron), where Abraham and Isaac had dwelt. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the days of Isaac were one hundred and eighty years. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Isaac breathed his last and died, and was "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Joined his ancestors"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "gathered to his people, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "being"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " old and full of days. And his sons Esau and Jacob buried him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}